sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Traefik
  participant Gateway
  participant Auth as auth-service
  participant Property as property-service

  Note over Browser,Traefik: HTTPS :443 site. HTTP :80 site 308. HTTP :80 /api Postman.
  Browser->>Traefik: HTTPS POST /api/auth/login
  Note over Traefik: TLS sonlandırma
  Traefik->>Gateway: HTTP /api/auth/login
  Gateway->>Auth: public, JWT yok
  Auth-->>Gateway: accessToken RS256 sub uid role
  Gateway-->>Traefik: JSON
  Traefik-->>Browser: HTTPS yanıt
  Note over Browser: localStorage avelrune.token

  Browser->>Traefik: HTTPS GET /api/properties/mine + Bearer
  Traefik->>Gateway: JWT RS256 public.pem
  Note over Gateway: X-Authenticated silinir. User Role User-Id yazılır.
  Gateway->>Property: HTTP X-Authenticated-User / Role / User-Id
  Property-->>Gateway: assigned_user_id eşleşen ilanlar
  Gateway-->>Traefik: JSON
  Traefik-->>Browser: HTTPS yanıt
